# LEGACY / HISTORICAL ONLY
#
# This file contains the old kernel-style export syntax.
# The project has completed the full conversion to NFS-Ganesha.
#
# Native Ganesha EXPORT {} blocks now live in the parent of this directory
# or in the directory bind-mounted as /etc/ganesha/exports.d/ inside the container.
#
# See README.md in this directory for the current format.
#
# This file is kept only as a historical reference and is no longer used.

# Old kernel syntax (no longer consumed):
# /export/share1   *(rw,sec=krb5p,no_root_squash,sync,hide)
